{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜支付三巨頭供應商遭黑客攻破 客戶姓名電郵外洩 核心系統無損           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">摩根大通、Visa及萬事達卡周四（19日）同告證實，為三家公司提供服務的第三方供應商遭黑客網絡攻擊，部分客戶的個人資料外洩，涉及姓名及電郵地址等。三家公司強調本身的支付網絡及核心系統未受波及，信用卡卡號等付款資料並無流出。消息拖累三股周四全線下挫，Visa收市跌3.1%，萬事達卡及摩根大通分別跌逾2%及逾1%。一個源自俄羅斯的勒索軟件組織已在暗網承認發動攻擊，並公開部分樣本資料。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:04:03.398376+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":224,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:00:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:57:37.709429+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:57:37.709429+00:00","content_hash":"d7fa6f8dc192529d3c61fb520cd1d6eafeca5a4e9efb58d670092c940705f621","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}